        {
          "text": "Kwĩanana na meko moo, now’o ũkeĩvanĩsya, ũthatu kwa nthũ syake, ũĩvanĩsyo kwa amaitha make; ila ithama akaĩvanĩsya ũndũ syeekie. ",
